  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "對外入口",
      "items": [
        "網域 albireo-*-frontend／-backend／-mcp.onpremiseadvisor.com，Cloudflare 開啟代理",
        "主機 nginx 用 onpremiseadvisor.com 憑證終結 HTTPS，轉發到 127.0.0.1 的宿主機埠號",
        "MCP 那份 nginx：proxy_buffering off、HTTP/1.1、body 上限 1m；營運端 MCP 正式環境不對外"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "容器與設定",
      "items": [
        "後端容器只開 HTTP 8080，前端容器是 nginx:alpine 的 :80",
        "appsettings.{環境}.json 不進映像，由 compose 掛入；日誌掛到 ~/albireo-volumes/*-logs",
        "前端 VITE_API_URL 在建構時打包，改了要重建映像"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "GitLab CI/CD",
      "items": [
        "Runner albireo-runner；只有 develop 推送時部署，stage、main 尚未設定",
        "SSH 到開發機 → git reset 到 origin/develop → docker compose up --build",
        "後端以 matrix 平行部署六個主機；staging、production 的 compose 埠號相同"
      ]
    }
  ]
